{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026d26XgsjbZn1794834097.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國務院總理李強在菲律賓出席中國－東盟領導人會議。雙方宣布將2027年定為人工智能(AI)合作年。李強表示，中國和東盟合作取得的成績令人振奮。</p><p></p><p>國務院總理李強表示：「今年是中國和東盟建立全面戰略夥伴關係五周年，過去五年大家都看到，國際上單邊主義，保護主義逆流湧動，地緣衝突此起彼伏，在這樣的背景下，我們中國和東盟合作逆勢而上，取得令人振奮的成績。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:59:29.046978+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T19:15:42.137253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:52:54.457829+00:00","content_hash":"2089225dabd43c6ef501a038cf21f9fbf0cb4f81158f98e867dd0a640ab867c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}